repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/replayable-image-editor"
url: "https://shuyaogao.github.io/replayable-image-editor/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): an image editor in which every edit is recorded
  as one JSON line. Replaying the log reproduces the canvas pixel for pixel, so the log is a
  ready-made behaviour-cloning dataset. The page shows each operation as JSON and as tokens,
  replays the log with quantised coordinates and colours at four presets and reports PSNR,
  and explains every adjustment (per-pixel formulas, colour matrices, convolution kernels).
keywords:
